WEBVTT

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.090
Good morning.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:38.880
It's almost noon.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.280
It's my day off. Give me a break.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.210
What is that?

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:47.560
Someone from the society just brought it for you.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:48.620
For me?

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:52.290
Yes. Why did you have it sent here?

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.610
Don't you have your own house?

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:59.610
I feel so comfortable living here. I've got all my lifelines, too.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.720
What is it? What is it?

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.900
Mind your manners, Rose.

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:08.460
Let's open it.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:15.460
"Lost Precious Appraisal Request."

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:18.000
I think I accepted this recently.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.060
You can appraise them?

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:23.590
I don't usually do it. It's a hassle.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:28.010
The Japanese branch is still recovering and is understaffed.

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:31.960
I accepted this because I thought it'd be a chance to appeal the Seven Tails.

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:37.510
I was going to appraise it there, but someone at the office must have sent it here by mistake.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:40.780
What do you think?

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.360
I can have it sent back if it bothers you.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:44.900
It's fine.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.670
There doesn't seem to be anything wrong with it.

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:49.680
Really? Then I'll tear this open.

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:55.070
It's a painting.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.030
Yes?

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:07.630
Uh, Ryuji-kun...

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:08.630
Ryuji.

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:46.220
"Kisaragi Ryuji"

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:50.490
"Mirror of Truth"

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.200
What are you two doing here?

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:50.740
I happened by this place while taking a walk.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:56.020
We didn't really get to talk last time, so I came to see you.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.740
I see.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:05.720
Um, here. I made you some cookies.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.640
Thanks.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.450
I made cupcakes with my mother.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:14.780
They're the failures, so you can have them.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:16.010
Thanks.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.820
You must be getting along with your parents.

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:21.560
Both my father and mother are kind to me.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:23.560
It's good to have a family.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.140
That's great.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.880
I'll make some tea. Come in.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.320
Ai, Misaki.

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.470
Welcome. You two are working hard even though it's the weekend.

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:42.460
They brought snacks. Let's eat them together.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.460
Thank you.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.880
You're welcome.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:48.640
What is this?

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.660
It's a Lost Precious.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.510
I'm supposed to appraise it.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:05:00.500
We can take our time looking into it later.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:02.790
This is delicious.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.190
They're really well made.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.780
Ryuji, say "aah."

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.060
I can feed myself.

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:10.150
No.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:20.420
It's my turn.

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.910
These really are good.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.040
Thank you.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:39.980
Liar?

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:41.840
What is that?

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.210
It means one who tells lies, doesn't it?

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:49.540
Could it be an English speaking city?

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:02.740
Ryuji!

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:04.180
Ryuji!

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:05.570
Ryuji-kun!

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.290
Ryuji-kun!

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:29.660
What is this?

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:35.190
We seem to have been sucked into that painting.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:47.590
I should be in Ryuji-kun's house.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:51.380
Is this a dream? Is it?

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.340
No, this is reality.

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:57.110
We've been dragged into that painting.

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:04.860
Lots of weird things happen around me and Ryuji. Sorry about that.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:11.410
But we'll find our way home. Just trust me.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.820
Okay.

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:16.760
It's okay. Ryuji will save us.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:18.000
Yeah.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.590
We should find an exit.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:34.370
"Kisaragi Ryuji"

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.630
"No Entry"

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.620
Misaki-chan.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.570
Let's go.

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:42.450
Okay.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:45.880
Did you find anything?

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.030
No.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.700
There's no one here. It's a ghost town.

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:56.660
While walking around, I thought this place seemed really familiar.

00:08:57.960 --> 00:09:00.140
That movie we saw the other day.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:01.970
Oh, that?

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.220
What did you watch?

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.620
One of those horror movies.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:10.260
A bunch of girls are chased around an American city by a murderer.

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:12.050
A murderer?

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:17.930
Its low budget makes it better. The murderer is just a guy in a costume with an axe.

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:21.600
What's wrong?

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:32.200
Just like that.

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:44.810
Watch out!

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.540
It didn't work. Let's run.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.450
Hide in there.

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:08.310
It's locked.

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:10.260
What? It was open a second ago.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.650
Eriko, that house!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:42.040
Ryuji.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.690
Ryuji-kun.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:44.940
Ryuji.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.750
Hurry up and save us!

00:10:58.100 --> 00:10:59.120
Damn it!

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.310
Why won't it work?

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:25.580
I can think of plenty of reasons.

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.540
Bianca! When did you get here?

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.080
No need to thank me.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.280
We help each other when we're in trouble.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:36.070
One for all, all for me.

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:38.000
I don't think that's what you mean.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.310
It's a type of Cursed Precious.

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:42.310
It seems to have some special conditions.

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.670
This place is empty, too.

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:52.050
Why are the lights on?

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:53.320
Who knows.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.880
I wish we had some weapons.

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.030
I can handle a gun.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:02.540
We need to come up with a way to defend ourselves against him.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.490
Eriko.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.000
There are stairs.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.910
I know we've already come this far, but...

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:19.840
in horror films, nothing good comes from going to the basement.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.940
Then why are we going?

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:27.540
Because we might find some information.

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.530
If it's a horror film, anyway.

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:35.250
Um, is this a dream? Is this reality?

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.380
Are we inside a horror film?

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:42.200
Just hope we find a happy ending.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:52.090
What are these photos?

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:58.910
This place is creepy and gross.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:04.410
But they key to our escape is probably in this room. Let's find it.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.180
I can't take any more of this.

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:29.070
What is...

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:34.090
What is your most precious memory?

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:38.910
Tell me your most precious memory.

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:44.120
My most precious memory...

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:46.800
Tell me!

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:54.530
When I was a child, my pet...

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:05.450
Are you okay, Misaki-chan?

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:17.400
Its activity is low. Rather than attacking, it traps those who come near.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:24.900
Judging from the situation, it targets those with two X chromosomes, or women.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.190
I hope everyone's all right.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:32.200
I don't know, but considering they're inside the canvas...

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:35.850
there's a good chance Lost Preciouses are rendered useless.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.910
Just like your knife.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:41.600
What can I do?

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:44.600
What's going on?

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:50.690
If we lie to that mirror, we'll end up like the girls in the photographs.

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:52.640
I...

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.650
I didn't lie.

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:02.710
We're next.

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:06.290
What happens if we turn into photos?

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.550
We'll probably never be able to leave.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.180
I won't be able to see Ryuji.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.150
I don't want that.

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:18.150
Neither do I.

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:23.530
Answer me.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.660
Answer me.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.630
Tell him what you think from the bottom of your heart.

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:39.310
Who would you die for?

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:42.910
What do you regret most?

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:46.360
What is your most precious memory?

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:50.930
Tell me. Tell me. Tell me.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.540
Who would you die for?

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:58.280
Ryuji.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:01.270
Why?

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.380
"Why?"

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:07.500
I have no reason. I would die for Ryuji any time.

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:12.790
Tell me. What do you regret most?

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:22.960
Three years ago when I took Ryuji-kun to an antique store.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:30.190
He lost control when he was possessed by a Cursed Precious.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:36.920
I was slightly injured.

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:42.340
He was the one who was hurt, though. He worried about it for a long time.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:49.050
That's my greatest regret, but we're both fine now.

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:53.560
We won't be bound by Cursed Preciouses forever, unlike you!

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:57.250
What is your most precious memory?

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:00.490
Tell him.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.650
You have to tell him.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:07.250
"Entrance Ceremony"

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.670
Are you okay?

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.810
Ryuji-kun...

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:46.260
Misaki, tell him so we can go home.

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:56.380
What is your most precious memory?

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:08.380
The time I met Ryuji-kun.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.320
Answer me.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.860
Ask your question.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:16.760
Who do you love most?

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:17.330
Ryuji!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:22.250
Ryuji, Ryuji, Ryuji...

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.400
Well, we already knew that.

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.620
I love Ryuji.

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:29.500
You're lying!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.780
You're lying. You're lying.

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.720
There's no way a woman would tell the truth.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:42.300
All women are liars!

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:44.440
Watch out!

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:46.970
Let's run.

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:56.520
When the painting attempts to capture a woman...

00:18:56.520 --> 00:19:00.170
in other words, when it comes in contact with the outside world...

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:02.700
we may have an opportunity to bring them back.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.820
You'll have your chance when the painting tries to take me.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.790
I'm sorry. I'll save you.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.250
Rose.

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:31.380
Ryuji.

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:32.660
Ryuji-kun.

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:33.930
Bianca?

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:36.000
There it is.

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:37.170
Ryuji.

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.170
Ryuji-kun.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:39.330
Ryuji.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:40.210
Their voices.

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:41.100
Do it.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:23.800
Ryuji.

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:27.310
Ryuji, Ryuji, Ryuji.

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:28.960
Rose.

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:45.890
This was painted by a man imprisoned after he was betrayed by his lover.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:48.640
That explains why he was obsessed with lies.

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:52.430
That's why the truth was the key to escaping.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:56.780
I didn't think much of it when I accepted, but it was pretty dangerous.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.750
I'm glad we had Ryuji-kun.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:01.750
Don't ignore me.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.600
You owe me for this one.

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:07.680
Hey.

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:13.370
If you hadn't told the truth, we wouldn't have escaped from that room.

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:15.340
Eat this.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:16.920
Thank you.

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:20.850
Why do you keep talking about the truth?

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.040
Who knows?

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:27.960
It's a secret.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.590
It means we all love you, Ryuji.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:35.510
What a picturesque happy ending.

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:39.810
But if it's a horror film, something should happen now.

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:43.460
Yeah, right.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:39.890
Next episode "Adult's Ritual"

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:29.490
I'm Sapphie. I'm finally making my appearance at the end of the series.

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:32.620
Actually, Dragon Crisis is just getting started.

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:37.290
My mature romance will blow away the romantic comedy you've been watching.

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:39.390
The object of my love is him.
